      "entity_class": "COMMUNICATION_TEMPLATE",
      "type": "call_script",
      "description": "A call centre script designed to handle customer inquiries regarding Direct Debit charges. It guides the agent through explaining what a Direct Debit is, gathering transaction details, and offering cancellation or refund options.",
      "context": [
        "Agent: \"Let me look that up for you. A Direct Debit is when a company (like a utility or insurance) automatically deducts payment from your account.\"",
        "If you didn't authorize it or want to cancel, I can help: Option 1: Cancel the Direct Debit with us (immediate) Option 2: Contact [Company] directly to cancel",
        "Either way, if you were charged without authorization, we'll refund you within 10 days."
